TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Calcite in hydrothermal solution at 100C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1.0

RATES
Calcite
-start
10  si_cc = SI("Calcite")
20  IF (si_cc >= 0) THEN GOTO 90
30  rate = PARM(1) * PARM(2) * (1 - 10^si_cc)
40  moles = rate * TIME
50  IF (moles > M) THEN moles = M
60  SAVE moles
90  SAVE 0
-end

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -m0    1.0
    -m     1.0
    -parms 10.0  0.001
    -step  1000 in 100
    -tol   1e-8

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetic.sel
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -pH     true
    -pe     true
    -si     Calcite

END
